  ["That was definitely a human hand sticking out of the pile of debris at the crime scene, and it was still moving!"] = "Definitivamente era uma mão humana saindo da pilha de destroços na cena do crime, e ainda estava em movimento!",
  ["Evidence of Crime"] = "Provas de Crime",
