  ["On the raging sea, a huge sailing ship is breaking through the waves and sailing forward. \n Emperor Roselle stands on the deck, looking into the distance, with four cannons on each side."] = "No mar revolto, um enorme veleiro rompe as ondas e navega em frente. \n O Imperador Roselle está no convés, olhando para longe, com quatro canhões de cada lado.",
