  ["Adapted from the novel of the same name by bestselling author Fors Wall, the play \"The Great Adventurer\" is currently showing at the Golden Indus Theater!"] = "Adaptado do romance homônimo do autor best-seller Fors Wall, a peça \"O Grande Aventureiro\" está em exibição no Golden Indus Theatre!",
