  ["The feast's popularity has reached <HighLight>[%s]</>, and the Host of the Feast, <HighLight>[%s]</>, has felt everyone's enthusiasm and unlocked popularity rewards!!"] = "A popularidade da festa atingiu <HighLight> [ %s ] </> , e o Anfitrião da Festa, <HighLight> [ %s ] </> , sentiu o entusiasmo de todos e desbloqueou recompensas de popularidade!!",
